    "A low or a high alerts only once glucose has been out of range this long in a row. Very low and extremely high never wait. A bounce back into range smaller than the margin is the same episode: no new first alert, and its treatments still count." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A low or a high alerts only once glucose has been out of range this long in a row. Very low and extremely high never wait. A bounce back into range smaller than the margin is the same episode: no new first alert, and its treatments still count."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Una alerta de glucosa baja o alta solo suena cuando la glucosa lleva este tiempo seguido fuera de rango. Muy baja y extremadamente alta nunca esperan. Un rebote hacia el rango menor que el margen es el mismo episodio: no hay una nueva primera alerta y sus tratamientos siguen contando."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A phone" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A phone"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Un móvil"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Abbott is servicing LibreView, so LibreLinkUp sends no glucose. It comes back by itself when that ends. To get glucose meanwhile, change the source." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Abbott is servicing LibreView, so LibreLinkUp sends no glucose. It comes back by itself when that ends. To get glucose meanwhile, change the source."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Abbott está haciendo mantenimiento de LibreView, así que LibreLinkUp no envía glucosa. Vuelve sola cuando acabe. Para tener glucosa mientras tanto, cambia el origen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
