    "Their settings decide the ranges, the trend arrow, the time shown, the rings, the lines, the last treatment, the sensor countdown and when to alert; This Mac's own lets you set them here. Sounds, the no-data alert, the notification's buttons and each place's own time shown and sensor time are always this Mac's." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Their settings decide the ranges, the trend arrow, the time shown, the rings, the lines, the last treatment, the sensor countdown and when to alert; This Mac's own lets you set them here. Sounds, the no-data alert, the notification's buttons and each place's own time shown and sensor time are always this Mac's."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sus ajustes deciden los rangos, la flecha de tendencia, el tiempo mostrado, los anillos, las líneas, el último tratamiento, la cuenta atrás del sensor y cuándo avisar; Los de este Mac te deja ajustarlos aquí. Los sonidos, la alerta de sin datos, los botones de la notificación y el tiempo mostrado y el tiempo del sensor de cada sitio son siempre de este Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
