    "While this Mac follows nobody, it can read glucose from Juggluco's web server on the same network (in Juggluco: Settings › Web server, with Local only off). Plain http on your home network only: readings travel unencrypted between the phone and this Mac." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "While this Mac follows nobody, it can read glucose from Juggluco's web server on the same network (in Juggluco: Settings › Web server, with Local only off). Plain http on your home network only: readings travel unencrypted between the phone and this Mac."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mientras este Mac no sigue a nadie, puede leer la glucosa del servidor web de Juggluco en la misma red (en Juggluco: Ajustes › Servidor web, con «Local only» desactivado). Solo http sin cifrar en tu red de casa: las lecturas viajan sin cifrar entre el móvil y este Mac."
          }
        }
