          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While a Focus (Do Not Disturb, Sleep…) is on, macOS holds Sukrara's alerts back like any app's, unless you allow Sukrara in it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "While a Focus (Do Not Disturb, Sleep…) is on, macOS holds Sukrara's alerts back like any app's, unless you allow Sukrara in it."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mientras una concentración (No molestar, Dormir…) está activa, macOS retiene las alertas de Sukrara como las de cualquier app, salvo que permitas Sukrara en ella."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Alerts that ring like an alarm are Time Sensitive: they come through every Focus that allows Time Sensitive notifications." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Alerts that ring like an alarm are Time Sensitive: they come through every Focus that allows Time Sensitive notifications."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Las alertas que suenan como una alarma son urgentes: pasan por cualquier concentración que permita notificaciones urgentes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Time Sensitive notifications are off for Sukrara, so a Focus still holds its alerts back. Turn them on in Sukrara's notification settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Time Sensitive notifications are off for Sukrara, so a Focus still holds its alerts back. Turn them on in Sukrara's notification settings."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Las notificaciones urgentes de Sukrara están desactivadas, así que una concentración sigue reteniendo sus alertas. Actívalas en los ajustes de notificaciones de Sukrara."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This build of Sukrara can't send Time Sensitive alerts. To get its alerts during a Focus, allow Sukrara in that Focus." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This build of Sukrara can't send Time Sensitive alerts. To get its alerts during a Focus, allow Sukrara in that Focus."
