    },
    "Rapid insulin you log keeps every high and rising fast alert quiet while it starts working. If glucose is still high after that, it alerts at once." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rapid insulin you log keeps every high and rising fast alert quiet while it starts working. If glucose is still high after that, it alerts at once."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La insulina rápida que registras silencia todas las alertas de glucosa alta y de subida rápida mientras empieza a actuar. Si después sigue alta, avisa al momento."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Carbs you log keep low and falling fast alerts quiet while they work, and very low too on the phone that gets your glucose. A phone or Mac that follows you still alerts on a very low." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Carbs you log keep low and falling fast alerts quiet while they work, and very low too on the phone that gets your glucose. A phone or Mac that follows you still alerts on a very low."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los hidratos que registras silencian las alertas de baja y bajada rápida mientras actúan, y también la muy baja en el móvil que recibe tu glucosa. Un móvil o Mac que te sigue avisa igualmente de una muy baja."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While the last readings show glucose clearly falling back into range in time, high and very high alerts wait. They come at once if it stalls or the readings stop." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "While the last readings show glucose clearly falling back into range in time, high and very high alerts wait. They come at once if it stalls or the readings stop."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mientras las últimas lecturas muestran que la glucosa baja claramente hacia el rango a tiempo, las alertas de alta y muy alta esperan. Llegan enseguida si se estanca o dejan de llegar lecturas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While the last readings show glucose clearly rising back into range in time, low alerts wait. They come at once if it stalls or the readings stop. A very low waits only on the phone that gets your glucose, never its first alert." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "While the last readings show glucose clearly rising back into range in time, low alerts wait. They come at once if it stalls or the readings stop. A very low waits only on the phone that gets your glucose, never its first alert."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mientras las últimas lecturas muestran que la glucosa sube claramente hacia el rango a tiempo, las alertas de baja esperan. Llegan enseguida si se estanca o dejan de llegar lecturas. Una muy baja solo espera en el móvil que recibe tu glucosa, nunca su primera alerta."
          }
        }
      }
    },
