            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Va a la izquierda de la métrica principal, si cabe. Un widget pequeño muestra menos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The main metric sits at the right end, at full strength. In the sensor's last hours its countdown ring goes around it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The main metric sits at the right end, at full strength. In the sensor's last hours its countdown ring goes around it."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La métrica principal va en el extremo derecho, con toda su intensidad. En las últimas horas del sensor, su anillo de cuenta atrás la rodea."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The metrics, the last treatment and the time-in-range rings go back to their defaults. Your ranges stay." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The metrics, the last treatment and the time-in-range rings go back to their defaults. Your ranges stay."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Las métricas, el último tratamiento y los anillos de tiempo en rango vuelven a sus valores por defecto. Tus rangos se mantienen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The ring's colours clockwise from 12 o'clock. Drag a range to move it, or Control-click it for Move Up and Move Down." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The ring's colours clockwise from 12 o'clock. Drag a range to move it, or Control-click it for Move Up and Move Down."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los colores del anillo en el sentido del reloj desde las 12. Arrastra un rango para moverlo, o haz clic con Control para Subir y Bajar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The time shown, the metrics, the lines, the ranges, the last treatment and the sensor settings go back to their defaults." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The time shown, the metrics, the lines, the ranges, the last treatment and the sensor settings go back to their defaults."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El tiempo mostrado, las métricas, las líneas, los rangos, el último tratamiento y los ajustes del sensor vuelven a sus valores por defecto."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The time since your last rapid insulin or carbs, the amount, and a ring for the time its alerts stay quiet. Rapid insulin shows for 4 h, carbs for up to 3 h; long-acting insulin and notes don't show." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The time since your last rapid insulin or carbs, the amount, and a ring for the time its alerts stay quiet. Rapid insulin shows for 4 h, carbs for up to 3 h; long-acting insulin and notes don't show."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El tiempo desde tu última insulina rápida o hidratos, la cantidad y un anillo con el tiempo que sus alertas siguen en silencio. La insulina rápida se muestra durante 4 h y los hidratos hasta 3 h; la insulina lenta y las notas no se muestran."
          }
        }
      }
    },
